      "uid": "zhcn:89c6fb6b57d7dbf38844969d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『NHK英里杯』的前一天，\n莱茵力量来到了夜晚的东京赛场。\n在那里她碰到了勇敢之心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06947241a5d7bf0acecdd0a89fa23a39dc4066c4cb633ed108ad138a57aa838f",
