      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心的目标本来应该是三后冠的，\n然而却又选择了『NHK英里杯』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cfeec2c95802007f9eefb2b8db3b2ee85cbe29e6ba2c2ce322c24fdbf6f2651",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
