      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "关于这一点，勇敢之心给出了回答。\n原因只有一个——那就是自己憧憬着\n要去开拓前人未踏足过的莱茵力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a6b8a0c951f68528fd19af843ab75394ea4b9a5983d8007a14325438254e53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
