      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为这句话，莱茵力量更加坚信\n自己一定能抓住只属于自己的光辉。\n然后，『NHK英里杯』正式到来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f2ce2bd108bdad3b99a7e5cd255a9035f3e4d9adf5c19f2d21a958e08f905f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
