      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『橡树大赛』当天，同期的马娘们\n都对莱茵力量选择了变则路线感到惊讶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bbdd6adcc2969b996018b63bea253cc9e59ef08f14c775641fa9e83a28eb0d5",
