      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『高松宫纪念』当天，莱茵力量很苦恼。\n为了超越后冠赛马娘前辈们，\n自己应该要达成什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f582253151a80fb9fa75dfbce57030a0636dc1cb1deb3e3dc0911f9a2a9617c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
