      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，训练员建议不必非要追求史上最初。\n之后她意识到，自己所拥有的闪耀，\n就是自己朝着目标前进的身姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87579774ce38c963c2eb961b216897a26b9c759587398b3b8fd1753c3b1d6454",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
