      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，前来观看『高松宫纪念』的\n空中气槽等人注意到了，人们越来越关注\n曾活跃在赛场上的后冠赛马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bac08a78d8929aeb5d6dadc04d248278088f873ad98abee6c6cf2255d3d089e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
