      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其中缘由自然是莱茵力量她们的活跃。\n备受瞩目的『高松宫纪念』开始了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0145ef580e7352560e3f84d349dfae5d0e7b91c9ffdeb957f6b10175e69a9f",
