    {
      "uid": "zhcn:756eb7c5b1c99bbf748025d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒来时，西沙里奥正担心地看着她。\n这么长时间的午睡，是不是太累了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb4a943e9bda062bee06be7a8d22b22ffcc51058af506b7ce846a7c93e7cae55",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
