    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c57ae80f2b44cdcf5983fb86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不如说反而是热情高涨，莱茵力量答道。\n因为憧憬的后冠赛马娘们的参赛，\n让观众们沸腾了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89910e68e917c01fc0ea321bce81e434b9868bc95e41304d4f97de37b4a1340c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
